          "number": "1(j)",
          "category": null,
          "questionText": "If $\\sin x = 0.3$, $\\cos\\alpha = 0.6$ and $\\tan\\theta = 0.7$, find the value of $\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2} - x\\right)$.",
          "questionFigures": [],
          "solution": {
